# NOTE: a bare `migrations` used to live here. It matches a directory of that
# name at ANY depth, so it silently excluded supabase/migrations/ — including
# the RLS + admin policies that all of this project's access control depends on.
# Those must be in version control. If you need to ignore a generated
# migrations directory, anchor the pattern to it (e.g. /some/path/migrations).